      "1": "<p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>就业情况</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2025<span xss=removed>年，学校通过多种举措推动就业工作，就业成效得到显著提升。</span><span xss=removed>2025</span><span xss=removed>届毕业生总数为</span><span xss=removed>2890</span><span xss=removed>人，其中男生</span><span xss=removed>738</span><span xss=removed>人，占比</span><span xss=removed>25.54%</span><span xss=removed>；女生</span><span xss=removed>2152</span><span xss=removed>人，占比</span><span xss=removed>74.46%</span><span xss=removed>。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><img width=\"500\" src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn/upload/image/20260904/1788508433185677.png\" vwidth=\"500\" vheight=\"\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FC164F6D3206812B05FABC2968DB80FB/1AAA87ED/5606\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" orisrc=\"/__local/F/C1/64/F6D3206812B05FABC2968DB80FB_1AAA87ED_5606.png\" xss=removed></p><p xss=removed></p><p><br></p><br><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed> 图</span>2-3<span xss=removed>毕业生性别比例图 </span></span></strong></p><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>(</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>数据来源：麦可思</span>-<span xss=removed>保山中医药高等专科学校</span><span xss=removed>202</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>5</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>届毕业生培养质量评价数据</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>)</span></strong><strong xss=removed></strong></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2025<span xss=removed>届毕业生主要生源：云南</span><span xss=removed>2785</span><span xss=removed>人、贵州</span><span xss=removed>34</span><span xss=removed>人、四川</span><span xss=removed>30</span><span xss=removed>人、安徽</span><span xss=removed>13</span><span xss=removed>人。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></strong></p><p xss=removed><img width=\"500\" src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn/upload/image/20260904/1788508434408384.png\" vwidth=\"500\" vheight=\"\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2B0806BD7017690C5F947212FCFA71CD/2E62C63D/A852\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" orisrc=\"/__local/2/B0/80/6BD7017690C5F947212FCFA71CD_2E62C63D_A852.png\" xss=removed></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>图  </span>2-4 <span xss=removed>毕业生生源结构图</span></span></p><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>(</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>数据来源：麦可思</span>-<span xss=removed>保山中医药高等专科学校</span><span xss=removed>202</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>5</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>届毕业生培养质量评价数据</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>)</span></strong><strong xss=removed></strong></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>毕业生就业落实情况整体较好。学校</span>20</span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>25</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>届毕业生的毕业去向落实率为</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>94.05</span></span><span xss=removed>%<span xss=removed>，毕业生就业落实较为充分。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><img width=\"379\" src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn/upload/image/20260904/1788508434698143.png\" vwidth=\"379\" vheight=\"\" vurl=\"/_vsl/48C96997BB61317F9718A04642187146/A1240915/1991\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" orisrc=\"/__local/4/8C/96/997BB61317F9718A04642187146_A1240915_1991.png\" xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></strong></p><p xss=removed></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>图  </span>2-5 <span xss=removed>毕业生的毕业去向落实率</span></span></p><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>(</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>数据来源：麦可思</span>-<span xss=removed>保山中医药高等专科学校</span><span xss=removed>202</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>5</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>届毕业生培养质量评价数据</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>)</span></strong><strong xss=removed></strong></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>毕业生主要服务于</span><span xss=removed>“</span><span xss=removed>一带一路</span><span xss=removed>”</span><span xss=removed>地区、长江经济带等重点战略区域发展。学校积极引导毕业生服务</span><span xss=removed>“</span><span xss=removed>一带一路</span><span xss=removed>”</span><span xss=removed>地区、长江经济带等国家发展战略，面向重点区域就业，为国家经济建设与产业结构转型提供人才支持。学校</span><span xss=removed>2025</span><span xss=removed>届毕业生中，</span><span xss=removed>94.72%</span><span xss=removed>的毕业生在</span><span xss=removed>“</span><span xss=removed>一带一路</span><span xss=removed>”</span><span xss=removed>地区就业，赴长江经济带就业的占比为</span><span xss=removed>92.45%</span><span xss=removed>。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></p><p xss=removed><img width=\"481\" src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn/upload/image/20260904/1788508435610769.png\" vwidth=\"481\" vheight=\"\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D0AF5CE5A83811473347177B071707DB/B99420F4/AE40\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" orisrc=\"/__local/D/0A/F5/CE5A83811473347177B071707DB_B99420F4_AE40.png\" xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>图</span>2-6 <span xss=removed>重点区域就业比例</span></span></p><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>(</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>数据来源：麦可思</span>-<span xss=removed>保山中医药高等专科学校</span><span xss=removed>202</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>5</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>届毕业生培养质量评价数据</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>)</span></strong><strong xss=removed></strong></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2.4<span xss=removed>创新创业</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2.4.1<span xss=removed>创新创业教育人才培养</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>依托《职业生涯规划》《就业指导》两门课程教学，通过课程设计、教材研究、场景植入、实践引领等，增强学生的创新精神、创业意识。坚持以赛促教、以赛促学、以赛促创，通过组织学生参加互联网</span>+<span xss=removed>创新创业大赛、职业生涯规划大赛、模拟面试大赛、简历设计大赛、挑战杯等竞赛类活动提高学生求职创业能力。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2.4.2<span xss=removed>强化学生创新创业专项训练</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>学校组织实施的</span><span xss=removed>“</span><span xss=removed>宏志助航计划</span><span xss=removed>——</span><span xss=removed>全国高校毕业生就业能力培训</span><span xss=removed>”</span><span xss=removed>工作，以责任感和使命感圆满完成培训任务。培训全程采用体验式教学模式，课程聚焦大学生职业生涯发展和就业创业能力提升，增强学生认识和解决问题的能力，激发求职热情与潜能，提升求职能力。经过</span><span xss=removed>8</span><span xss=removed>天培训，</span><span xss=removed>5</span><span xss=removed>个学院的</span><span xss=removed>400</span><span xss=removed>位同学顺利结业，较去年增加</span><span xss=removed>330</span><span xss=removed>人，成效显著。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2.4.3<span xss=removed>举办创新创业大赛</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>积极组织创新创业大赛，将大赛激发的家国情怀作为筑牢思想根基、铸就精神之魂的思想源泉。以大赛为舞台，将师生的求是精神和务实作风转化为干事创业动力。班主任和辅导员要动员学生参赛，做好指导工作，确保大赛圆满收官。开展大赛能促进大学生创新创业、拓展素质教育、提高学生综合素质、营造良好学习氛围、推动社会实践发展。本次大赛能调动学生自主创业、就业积极性，提升其相关认识，激发学习动力与活力。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed>2.4.4<span xss=removed>创新创业成效</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>在</span>2025<span xss=removed>年中国国际大学生创新大赛（云南赛区选拔赛）中，我校荣获金奖</span><span xss=removed>1</span><span xss=removed>项、银奖</span><span xss=removed>1</span><span xss=removed>项、铜奖</span><span xss=removed>4</span><span xss=removed>项；在第二届云南省大学生职业生涯规划大赛中，荣获成长赛道铜奖</span><span xss=removed>1</span><span xss=removed>项，实现了在此类高水平赛事中奖项的</span><span xss=removed>“</span><span xss=removed>零的突破</span><span xss=removed>”</span><span xss=removed>。二是大力加强就业指导课程与师资队伍建设</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>，</span></span><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>成功申报立项省级就业指导</span><span xss=removed>“</span><span xss=removed>金课</span><span xss=removed>”1</span><span xss=removed>项，标志着我校就业指导课程建设迈上新台阶。同时，积极鼓励教师提升专业化水平，组织</span><span xss=removed>5</span><span xss=removed>名教师参加培训并考取职业指导师（或相关）认证，为提升全校就业指导服务水<span xss=removed><span xss=removed>平提供了坚实的师资支撑。</span></span></span></span></p><p xss=removed><img width=\"500\" src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn/upload/image/20260904/1788508436329766.png\" vwidth=\"500\" vheight=\"\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5A263199A7759BAF685CF82B88525A4F/B09C7A90/7263\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" orisrc=\"/__local/5/A2/63/199A7759BAF685CF82B88525A4F_B09C7A90_7263.png\" xss=removed></p><p xss=removed></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>2<span xss=removed>.4.5<span xss=removed>创业情况</span></span></span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>根据</span>2025<span xss=removed>届毕业生培养质量评价数据，学生创业的形式主要是创立公司（</span><span xss=removed>42.86%</span><span xss=removed>）、互联网创业（</span><span xss=removed>29.32%</span><span xss=removed>）、工作室创业（</span><span xss=removed>16.54%</span><span xss=removed>）。</span></span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></p><p xss=removed><img width=\"500\" height=\"210\" title=\"undefined\" alt=\"undefined\" src=\"https://static-data.gaokao.cn/upload/image/20260904/1788508436862261.png\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" vwidth=\"500\" vheight=\"210\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4470B2317149FD4FB20584CE0F185413/1E65F19B/3ECD\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" orisrc=\"/__local/4/47/0B/2317149FD4FB20584CE0F185413_1E65F19B_3ECD.png\" xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>图</span>2-7 <span xss=removed>毕业生创业的形式</span></span></p><p xss=removed><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>(</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>数据来源：麦可思</span>-<span xss=removed>保山中医药高等专科学校</span><span xss=removed>202</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>5</span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed><span xss=removed>届毕业生培养质量评价数据</span></span></strong><strong xss=removed><span xss=removed>)</span></strong><strong xss=removed></strong></p><p xss=removed><span xss=removed> </span></p><p xss=removed><br></